# The auditor the production dependency audit job runs
# (.github/workflows/ci.yml). It reads requirements/production.txt, the
# dependency set of the published distribution with both extras, compiled from
# pyproject.toml the way requirements/dev.txt is; the command that regenerates
# that lock is recorded at its top.
#
# Regenerate the hash-pinned lock file after editing:
#   uv pip compile --generate-hashes --universal --python-version 3.10 requirements/audit.in -o requirements/audit.txt
pip-audit
